{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[E]Now the station's fu[B]ll of morning light
[C#m]And the snow is onl[A]y memory white
[E]You still hum that [B]song you never wrote
[C#m]In the pocket of a bo[A]rrowed coat
{end_of_verse}

